   "html": "<p>For the launch of the latest Agatha Christie adaptation, <em>A Haunting in Venice</em>, IHC worked wtih 20th Century Studios to support dueling screenings across the coast in Los Angeles and New York City. </p>\n<p>We amplified the events with an interactive photo opp, in-world brand ambassadors, themed snacks, and targeted invite outreach.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "THE SCREENINGS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>In NYC, moody decor, themed refreshments, and costumed brand ambassadors immersed guests within the SVA Theatre. The Cobrasnake captured candid guest photos throughout the night. At the Roosevelt Hotel in LA, our brand ambassadors in masks and cloaks, provided a spooky element to the screening event while running the photo booth. </p>"
    },
